#. command help: didact compendium remove
#: didact/commands/compendium.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Deletes an entry added with `compendium add` (or written into\n"
"`systems/<pack>/homebrew/compendium/` by hand); `didact undo` brings it back.\n"
"Records spawned from it stay. A pack's own entries can't be deleted, but a house\n"
"rule can change them: `didact override add entry <entry> --data '{…}'`."
msgstr ""
"Elimina una voce aggiunta con `compendium add` (o scritta a mano in\n"
"`systems/<pack>/homebrew/compendium/`); `didact undo` la riporta indietro.\n"
"Le schede create da essa restano. Le voci proprie di un pack non si possono eliminare, ma una "
"regola\n"
"della casa può modificarle: `didact override add entry <entry> --data '{…}'`."

